ojector screen and sunshade designed for Tesla Model Y Refresh 2025\u20132026. It supports rear-seat, tailgate, and sky-roof viewing modes for parked-car entertainment, camping, road trips, outdoor projector setups, and portable movie nights with Aurzen ZIP or other compatible portable projectors.\n\nSpecifications\n\n* Brand: Aurzen\n* Product Name: TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen\n* Product Type: 2-in-1 Car Projector Screen & Sunshade\n* Vehicle Compatibility: Tesla Model Y Refresh 2025\u20132026\n* Screen Panels: Front Panel + Rear Panel\n* Front Panel Size: 1098 \u00d7 590 mm\n* Rear Panel Size: 1031 \u00d7 685 mm\n* Approx. Screen Size: 47\" + 50\"\n* Material: Steel, Polyester-Spandex Blend\n* Installation Method: Tool-Free Clip-In Installation\n* Portable: Yes\n* Foldable: Yes\n* Net Weight: 1 kg / 2.2 lbs\n* In the Box: Front Screen \u00d7 1, Rear Screen \u00d7 1, Carry Bag \u00d7 1, Side Clips \u00d7 8, Center Connect Clips \u00d7 2, Side Connect Clips \u00d7 2, User Manual \u00d7 1\n* Recommended Use: Parked Vehicle Viewing, Camping, Tailgate Movie Nights, Portable Projection\n* Safety Note: Use only when the vehicle is parked. Do not use while driving.\n\nUser Manual\n\nClick the link below to download the Aurzen TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen user manual in your preferred language:\n\nEnglish\n\nEspa\u00f1ol (Spanish)\n\nShipping Tip: Shipping begins within 1-3 days\n\nEstimated Standard Shipping Times (excluding preorders):\n\u2022 US/CA/UK/AU/JP: 3\u20137 business days\n\u2022 EU: 5\u201315 business days\n\nFast, Free Delivery\n\n30-Day Money-Back Guarantee\n\n1-Year Warranty\n\nLifetime Customer Support\n\n### Custom-Fit for Tesla Model Y\n\nDesigned for Tesla Model Y Refresh 2025\u20132026, the Aurzen TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen creates a more integrated in-car projection setup than a standard portable projector screen. The front and rear screen panels are shaped to fit the Model Y interior and panoramic roof area, making it ideal for parked-car entertainment, road trips, and private in-car movie nights.\n\n### 2-in-1 Projector Screen & Sunshade\n\nTravelPlay works as both a car projector screen and sunshade. The white projection surface provides a clean viewing area for portable projector use, while the silver-coated side helps block sunlight and reduce ambient light interference when placed along the panoramic roof. It\u2019s built for a more comfortable big-screen viewing experience inside your parked Tesla Model Y.\n\n### Detachable Dual-Screen Design\n\nThe detachable front and rear screens can be used together or separately for different viewing setups. Use both panels to create an in-car theater experience, or use a single rear screen for outdoor projection near the trunk area. This flexible dual-screen design makes TravelPlay suitable for rear-seat viewing, tailgate movie nights, camping, and portable projector setups.\n\n### Three Viewing Modes for Parked-Car Entertainment\n\nSwitch between Rear-Seat Theater Mode, Tailgate Theater Mode, and Sky-Roof Theater Mode to match the moment. Whether you\u2019re relaxing inside the car, setting up an outdoor movie night at the trunk, or creating a sky-roof projection experience, TravelPlay turns your parked Model Y into a flexible AutoCinema space.\n\n### Quick, Secure Clip-In Installation\n\nNo drilling, screws, or extra tools required. TravelPlay uses custom-fit clips to help secure the screen panels in place for a stable setup. Simply identify the front and rear screens, align them with the vehicle interior, and clip them into position before starting your projector viewing experience.\n\n### Foldable, Portable & Easy to Store\n\nBuilt with a flexible steel frame and polyester-spandex blend, TravelPlay folds down for compact storage after use. The included carry bag keeps the screen panels and clips organized, making it easy to store in your Tesla Model Y for camping, road trips, tailgate events, and outdoor movie nights.\n\n## Safety Notes\n\nThis product features a clip-on mounting design. Improper installation may cause the screen to fall. Please follow all instructions carefully to ensure safety:\n\n* Travelplay is designed for the Tesla Model Y Juniper 2025-2026. Due to model changes, it is compatible with the overall dimensions of the Tesla Model Y 2020-2024 in Starlight Roof Movie mode, but the rear screen cannot fully cover the window.\n* Do not scratch the screen with sharp objects, as this may damage the coating.\n* Always follow safety guidelines when assembling or disassembling the product to avoid damage to the product or personal injury.\n* Projection function is for use only when the vehicle is stationary.\n* Ensure all clips are fully inserted into the inner rim to prevent accidental detachment.\n* If using MagPlay for rear-seat projection, regularly check that the suction surface is clean and smooth. Dust, oil, or scratches may affect adhesion.\n* Keep the white projection surface clean to maintain optimal image quality.\n\n## FAQ\n\nIs Aurzen TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen designed for Tesla Model Y?\n\nYes. Aurzen TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen is designed for Tesla Model Y Refresh 2025\u20132026. It features custom-fit front and rear screen panels that work with the vehicle\u2019s interior and panoramic roof area, creating a cleaner in-car projector screen setup than a standard portable screen.\n\nFit may vary on earlier Tesla Model Y versions due to differences in vehicle design and interior layout.\n\nCan I use TravelPlay as a projector screen for camping or tailgate movie nights?\n\nYes. TravelPlay can be used as a portable car projector screen for camping, tailgate movie nights, and outdoor viewing when your Tesla Model Y is parked. The rear screen panel can be set up near the trunk area to create a tailgate theater setup with Aurzen ZIP or another compatible portable projector.\n\nFor the best outdoor viewing experience, use the screen after sunset or in a low-light environment.\n\nHow does the 2-in-1 projector screen and sunshade design work?\n\nTravelPlay works as both a car projector screen and sunshade. The white screen surface provides a clean projection area for movies, shows, and portable projector viewing, while the silver-coated side helps block sunlight and reduce ambient light interference when placed along the panoramic roof.\n\nThis makes it useful for both daytime shade and parked-car entertainment.\n\nWhat viewing modes does TravelPlay support?\n\nAurzen TravelPlay supports three viewing modes: Rear-Seat Theater Mode, Tailgate Theater Mode, and Sky-Roof Theater Mode.\n\nUse Rear-Seat Theater Mode for a private in-car movie experience, Tailgate Theater Mode for outdoor projection near the trunk, and Sky-Roof Theater Mode for relaxed viewing under the panoramic roof. These modes make TravelPlay suitable for road trips, camping, travel breaks, and parked-car movie nights.\n\nIs TravelPlay easy to install and store?\n\nYes. TravelPlay uses a tool-free clip-in installation system, so no drilling, screws, or extra tools are required. The detachable front and rear screens can be installed with the included clips, then folded and stored in the carry bag after use.\n\nThe foldable design makes it easy to keep in your Tesla Model Y for camping, road trips, outdoor movies, and portable projector setups.\n\nSafety Note: Projection use is intended only when the vehicle is parked. Do not watch projected content while driving.\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2\\. \u3010turn116096search1\u3011\n\n**Title\\:** Aurzen TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen for Tesla Model Y \u2014 \\$11.99 off with code CJ10, tested in Aurzen's cart 2026-10-26 \u00b7 Dealectric\n\n**URL\\:** \ue200url\ue202https\\://dealectric.com/aurzen-travelplay-autocinema-tesla-model-y\ue202https://dealectric.com/aurzen-travelplay-autocinema-tesla-model-y\ue201\n\n**Full excerpt\\:**\n\n```text\n# Aurzen TravelPlay AutoCinema Screen for Tesla Model Y\n\nA clip-in screen-and-sunshade for the 2025\u20132026 Model Y that 